WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.040
Okay, so now you can see that we have a higher high,

00:03.040 --> 00:04.800
higher low and higher high.

00:04.800 --> 00:09.360
And for me to consider a market structure shift,

00:09.360 --> 00:12.960
I wanna see this level broken or this level here.

00:13.920 --> 00:16.040
So let's see.

00:16.040 --> 00:19.000
And as you can see, this is a example

00:19.000 --> 00:20.960
for a valid market structure shift.

00:20.960 --> 00:23.040
So now you can see these momentum,

00:23.040 --> 00:25.560
there's volume in this movement.

00:25.560 --> 00:27.520
You can clearly see that, all right?

00:27.520 --> 00:30.980
Your eyes must be trained to see the volume

00:30.980 --> 00:31.820
in these candles.

00:31.820 --> 00:35.400
So you can see this is a big move to the downside.

00:35.400 --> 00:36.240
And what it does,

00:36.240 --> 00:38.500
it leaves some peer-to-peer gap here as well.

00:38.500 --> 00:42.680
So now this for me is a valid market structure shift.

00:42.680 --> 00:45.720
So what you can do, for just an example,

00:45.720 --> 00:49.560
you can just take your, maybe take your entry from here.

00:49.560 --> 00:50.960
And if I play this through,

00:50.960 --> 00:53.480
you can see the price just goes down, right?

00:53.480 --> 00:55.200
So this is a valid market structure shift.

00:55.200 --> 00:57.280
Why? Because it has momentum.

